      "description": "Each volume server of the bundled object store, as it last said: its volumes of the most it keeps, what they take, deleted and not, and of its disk, what is free, what it keeps free (minFreeSpace), and what it may still fill before the store takes no more writes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "lake"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
